  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015, or any amending Order, no balustrades or other means of enclosure shall be erected on the roof of the extension(s). No roof of any part of the extension(s) shall be used for any recreational purpose and access shall only be for the purposes of the maintenance of the property or means of emergency escape. \rReason: To safeguard the privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\rLocation Plan\rSite & Location Plan A100\rExisting and Proposed Block Plan A101\rExisting Ground Floor Plan A102\rExisting Roof Plan A103\rExisting Front & Rear Elevation and Section A-A A104\rExisting Side Elevations A105\rProposed Ground Floor Plan A106\rProposed Roof Plan A107\rProposed Front & Rear Elevation and Section A-A A108\rProposed Side Elevations A109\rProposed Sight lines (Daylight & Sunlight) A110\rProposed Section A-A & B-B (Kitchen Layout) A111\r3D Visualisations - 20250113\rDesign and Access Statement\rNotice under Article 12: SuDS Assessment\rClassic Slim Wall Water butt information\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
